{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人黃翠如與黎諾懿向來相當老友，二人日前造訪馬來西亞，工作之餘，更展開了一場「吃不停」的美食之旅。</p><p>當中黃翠如在美食面前更是毫無偶像包袱，化身專業吃貨，在各種特色料理面前大吃特吃，並將相片分享到社交平台。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.209581+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:04:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.135677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.135677+00:00","content_hash":"07f262250eb33eacb02caa78e3ad2ad152c608ff147345af00fa12f1ecba34d8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}